;Description
:This template is used to link to a X profile.
;Syntax
:Place <code><nowiki>{{Twitter|<username>|description*|deleted*=}}</nowiki></code> and substitute <username> with the latter part of the Utaite's X Profile link. If necessary, use the article's talk page to discuss further details.

;Example<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:<pre>{{Twitter|Coe_oo|Coe's X description}}</pre>

;Will result in<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:{{Twitter|Coe_oo|Coe's X description}}

;Example<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:<pre>{{Twitter|deletedaccount|RetiredUtaite1's X description|deleted=true}}</pre>

;Will result in<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:{{Twitter|deletedaccount|RetiredUtaite1's X description|deleted=true}}

;note<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:description field is optional.
:use "deleted" field as shown above.

